0 Tipline — matched loads, sliding versus tipping (ballast exchanged)
0 Name: tipline-swapped.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LICENSE BSD-3-Clause : see ../licenses/tipline.txt
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // Original isolated collection add-on. One hub and one motor on A.
0 // Free loads have identical parts, mass, footprint and external frame.
0 // Main: left ballast low; right ballast high. Comparison exchanges only ballast heights.
0 // Reset the scene before each experiment; the motor restores the deck, not the loads.
